  help: {
    overline: 'Help Center',
    title: 'How Can We Help You?',
    searchPlaceholder: 'Search questions...',
    catAll: 'All',
    catGetStarted: '🚀 Getting Started',
    catStaking: '💰 Staking & Withdrawal',
    catNodes: '🏆 Node Levels',
    catReferral: '👥 Referral Rewards',
    catSecurity: '🔒 Security',
    catTrouble: '⚠️ Troubleshooting',
    q1: 'What is RWA Protocol?',
    a1: 'RWA Protocol is a decentralized staking protocol on Binance Smart Chain (BSC). Users stake USDT to earn daily RWA token rewards, while the node level system unlocks referral bonuses. The protocol uses a 50/50 model: 50% to Treasury reserve, 50% to community rewards pool.',
    q2: 'How do I get started? What are the steps?',
    a2: '4 steps: ① Download OKX or Binance App and create a Web3 wallet; ② Deposit USDT (BEP-20) to your wallet; ③ Click \'Connect Wallet\' on this site; ④ Go to Stake page, enter amount and confirm. Minimum stake: 100 USDT.',
    q3: 'Which wallets are supported?',
    a3: 'Supports all BSC-compatible wallets: OKX Wallet, Binance Web3 Wallet, MetaMask, TokenPocket, and others via WalletConnect. Recommended: use OKX or Binance App\'s built-in browser for the smoothest experience.',
    q4: 'How is daily yield calculated?',
    a4: 'Daily yield = your staked USDT × 0.8%, converted to RWA tokens at that day\'s price. Example: stake 1,000 USDT, RWA at $0.85, you earn 1,000 × 0.8% ÷ 0.85 ≈ 9.41 RWA daily. Rewards settle at UTC 00:00; arrival may have slight delay.',
    q5: 'What are the withdrawal limits?',
    a5: 'Withdrawal limits: ① Unified minimum: 100; ② RWA reward withdrawals still observe the 24-hour cooldown; ③ Immediate exits charge a flat 8% fee split into 3% buyback/burn, 3% treasury, and 2% community pool; ④ stRWA mode charges 0% fee and mints 120% as 30-day locked stRWA; ⑤ Gas still requires a small amount of BNB.',
    q6: 'Can I withdraw my principal anytime?',
    a6: 'Principal exits now depend on position type. Flexible USDT principal and flexible RWA principal use the dedicated principal-withdraw actions. Locked principal can be withdrawn after maturity. Only pre-maturity locked USDT uses Emergency Withdrawal, where the refundable amount is proportional to completed lock days, paid back in USDT, and remains irreversible for that selected position.',
    q7: 'What do node levels do?',
    a7: 'Node levels are L1–L9. Higher levels earn a higher USDT referral percentage when referred users stake, and L4+ can also join protocol revenue sharing. Referral rewards are calculated on the referred user’s stake amount, not on their daily static yield.',
    q8: 'How do I upgrade my node level?',
    a8: 'Node level upgrades are checked from your current personal stake, team stake, and structure. The exact live thresholds are shown on the Nodes & Referrals page and are applied automatically by the system; no manual application is needed.',
    q9: 'How do I invite friends?',
    a9: 'Find your wallet address on the Nodes & Referral page and share it with friends. When they stake for the first time, they enter your address in the \'Referral Address\' field — the relationship is automatically and permanently bound. Note: cannot be changed once bound.',
    q10: 'Are referral rewards in USDT or RWA?',
    a10: 'Dynamic rewards (referral rewards) are paid in USDT, not RWA. They are triggered when referred users stake, based on that stake amount and node-level compression rules, then credited to your claimable USDT balance.',
    q11: 'Has the contract been audited?',
    a11: 'Yes. RWA Protocol smart contracts have been audited by both SlowMist and CertiK. Full audit reports are publicly available on the Security & Audit page. We commit to new audits before every major upgrade.',
    q12: 'Are my funds safe?',
    a12: '⚠️ Important: RWA Protocol is an experimental DeFi product with inherent risks: ① Smart contract vulnerabilities (audited but not 100% guaranteed); ② Token price volatility; ③ Protocol parameter changes. Only invest what you can afford to lose. Past performance does not guarantee future results.',
    q13: 'What if wallet connection fails?',
    a13: 'Try in order: ① Confirm wallet is on BSC Mainnet (Chain ID: 56); ② Refresh page and reconnect; ③ Clear browser cache; ④ Update wallet app to latest version; ⑤ On mobile, try opening this page in OKX or Binance App\'s built-in browser.',
    q14: 'What if my transaction stays pending?',
    a14: 'This may happen during BSC network congestion. Solutions: ① Wait 10–30 minutes — usually auto-confirms; ② In wallet, find the transaction and \'Speed Up\' (increase gas); ③ If pending over 1 hour, check status on BSCScan; ④ When contacting support, provide your TX Hash.',
    q15: 'What if my rewards didn\'t arrive?',
    a15: 'Daily rewards settle at UTC 00:00 with up to 2-hour delay. Check: ① Dashboard \'Recent Activity\' for reward records; ② Confirm staking status is normal (emergency withdrawal not triggered); ③ If not arrived after 24 hours, contact community support via Telegram or Discord with your wallet address.',
    quickLinks: 'Quick Links',
    linkStake: 'Go to Stake',
